*> TEST-ASSERT: compares one expected and observed value and prints the result line of
*> contracts/test-harness.md §3. Test infrastructure (excluded from coverage).
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-ASSERT.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-EDITED          PIC -(19)9.
 01 WS-EXPECTED-TEXT   PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-OBSERVED-TEXT   PIC X(1024).
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
     IF TL-NUMBER
         MOVE TL-EXPECTED-N TO WS-EDITED
         MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-EDITED LEADING) TO WS-EXPECTED-TEXT
         MOVE TL-OBSERVED-N TO WS-EDITED
         MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-EDITED LEADING) TO WS-OBSERVED-TEXT
     ELSE
         MOVE TL-EXPECTED TO WS-EXPECTED-TEXT
         MOVE TL-OBSERVED TO WS-OBSERVED-TEXT
     END-IF
     IF WS-EXPECTED-TEXT = WS-OBSERVED-TEXT
         DISPLAY "TEST " FUNCTION TRIM(TL-CASE TRAILING) " PASS"
     ELSE
         DISPLAY "TEST " FUNCTION TRIM(TL-CASE TRAILING)
                 " FAIL expected=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-EXPECTED-TEXT TRAILING)
                 " observed=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OBSERVED-TEXT TRAILING)
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
